# Plan (opus, strong)

## Goal

Meditative #93 Growing Felinor, its tokens #93.1–#93.3 and #94 Shrinking Felinor each get:
- a catalog entry;
- a script, with base and Radiant tests for every clause of its BUILD M10 row;
